DTSTART:20260509T191500Z
DTEND:20260509T205500Z
DTSTAMP:20260509T191500Z
UID:cQUIeZTS3I
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 85 mins (1h25m)\n\nLebanese journalist Janay Boulos 
 and Syrian activist and cameraman Abd Alkader Habak share their extraordin
 ary love story\, told through 13 years of personal archives spanning revol
 utions\, war\, and exile. Director Janay Boulos scheduled to attend.\n\nht
 tps://www.siff.net/festival/birds-of-war\n\nEstimated start: 12:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
