DESCRIPTION:Duration: 97 mins (1h37m)\n\nMārama\, Taratoa Stappard’s fe
 ature debut\, is an anti-colonial horror story confronting oppression whil
 e honoring the strength and resilience of Māori women.\n\nhttps://www.sif
 f.net/festival/marama\n\nEstimated start: 15:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
