DTSTART:20260510T010000Z
DTEND:20260510T024000Z
DTSTAMP:20260510T010000Z
UID:gvPpQDlY81
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 81 mins (1h21m)\n\nOn the night of December 3\, 2024
 \, South Korea pushed back against its own president. The Seoul Guardians 
 puts you on the streets and inside the National Assembly chamber as it hap
 pened. Director Chul-Young Cho scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.ne
 t/festival/the-seoul-guardians\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
