DTSTART:20260510T033000Z
DTEND:20260510T052500Z
DTSTAMP:20260510T033000Z
UID:wyrxGYfdXb
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 96 mins (1h36m)\n\nWillem Dafoe plays a post office 
 employee whose early book of poetry is “rediscovered” by a group of as
 piring artists who adopt him as an elder statesman\, flattering him but al
 so causing him to question their authenticity.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/fes
 tival/late-fame\n\nEstimated start: 20:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
