DTEND:20260510T233000Z
DTSTAMP:20260510T213000Z
UID:DqiOULU7vA
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 101 mins (1h41m)\n\nA comedy writer struggles to pro
 cess the grief over his younger sister’s suicide in this Jay Duplass ens
 emble “traumedy\,” based on the real-life experiences of screenwriter 
 Adam Clayton-Holland’s emotionally raw memoir.Director Jay Duplass sched
 uled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/see-you-when-i-see-you\n\
 nEstimated start: 14:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
