BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maspalomas
DTSTART:20260511T003000Z
DTEND:20260511T024000Z
DTSTAMP:20260511T003000Z
UID:xW0UAh1MqY
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 115 mins (1h55m)\n\nAfter a stroke while vacationing
  in the gay haven of Maspalomas\, Vicente—played by José Ramón Soroiz\
 , winner of the 2026 Goya Award for Best Lead Actor—is placed in a nursi
 ng home where he’s forced back into the closet\, confronting a fight for
  freedom he thought he’d already won.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/m
 aspalomas\n\nEstimated start: 17:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
